                            my experiences
                              </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class ="col-md-auto subTitles"> 
                                    <p id ="myQuote"> I’ve had the great opportunity to gain experience in many areas of business and I carry those experiences everywhere I go. - me</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!--YOUR COMPANY HERE STUFF-->
                            <div class = "row justify-content-md-center">
                                <div class= "col-md-8 cardCenter">
