                                              <li>Designed and presented two UI/UX mockups in Figma for an app to improve customer relations.</li>
                                              <li>Led a team of five to implement a strategy to improve employees’ productivity and optimize office space use.</li>
                                              <li>Collaborated on the development of a business analytics product using Power BI for key stakeholders.</li>
